@startuml
title 智颐养老系统 - 动态路由生成时序图

skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2E4D7B
  ActorBorderColor #2E4D7B
  LifeLineBorderColor #2E4D7B
}

actor "用户" as user
participant "前端\npermission.js" as perm
participant "api/menu.js" as api
participant "SysMenuController" as ctrl
participant "SysMenuServiceImpl" as svc
participant "SysMenuMapper" as mapper
participant "MySQL" as db

== 登录后加载路由 ==
user -> user : 登录成功

user -> perm : GenerateRoutes()
perm -> api : getRouters()

api -> ctrl : GET /getRouters
ctrl -> svc : selectMenuTreeByUserId()
svc -> mapper : selectMenuTreeByUserId()

mapper -> db : 查询可用菜单
note right
  SELECT DISTINCT m.*
  FROM sys_menu m
  LEFT JOIN sys_role_menu rm
  ON m.menu_id = rm.menu_id
  LEFT JOIN sys_user_role ur
  ON rm.role_id = ur.role_id
  WHERE ur.user_id = #{userId}
  AND m.status = 0
  ORDER BY m.order_num
end note

db --> mapper : List<SysMenu>
mapper --> svc : 菜单列表

svc -> svc : buildMenus(menus)
note right
  构建RouterVo树:
  1. 筛选顶级菜单
     (parentId=0)
  2. 递归构建子菜单
  3. 设置component路径
  4. 设置meta信息
     (title, icon)
  5. 标记外链/内链
end note

svc --> ctrl : List<RouterVo>
ctrl --> api : JSON数组

api --> perm : 路由配置

== 前端处理 ==
perm -> perm : filterAsyncRouter()
note right
  将后端返回的
  component字符串转为
  实际的Vue组件导入:
  
  'system/user/index'
  → @/views/
    system/user/index
end note

perm -> perm : 合并常量路由\n+ 动态路由
perm -> router : router.addRoutes()
router -> router : 挂载动态路由

user -> user : 刷新菜单和视图

note left of RouterVo
  路由结构:
  {
    name: 'User',
    path: '/system/user',
    component: 'system/user/index',
    meta: {
      title: '用户管理',
      icon: 'user'
    },
    children: [...]
  }
end note

@enduml
